instance, and then we

00:32:42.010 --> 00:32:44.740
would then manage and operate
that instance for you.

00:32:44.740 --> 00:32:49.180
Now, you also have the
ability to then also choose

00:32:49.180 --> 00:32:54.010
to use the on premise deployment
to deploy into your own data

00:32:54.010 --> 00:32:56.140
center or into your
own private cloud

00:32:56.140 --> 00:32:59.110
and then have that
manage your API calls

00:32:59.110 --> 00:33:01.690
and mediate and broker
it between the two

00:33:01.690 --> 00:33:03.970
environments or multiple
environments itself.

00:33:03.970 --> 00:33:06.160
The questions are
