00:34:44.639 --> 00:34:47.699
So if you're using our
managed services itself,

00:34:47.699 --> 00:34:51.300
we have two options,
and some customers

00:34:51.300 --> 00:34:55.409
choose to use one or the other,
or some customers use both.

00:34:55.409 --> 00:34:57.390
And typically, what
they do is they

00:34:57.390 --> 00:35:02.160
use IP whitelisting where we
can provide you a range of IPs.

00:35:02.160 --> 00:35:05.640
And they also use neutral TLS
where the certificates are

00:35:05.640 --> 00:35:11.760
provisioned to ensure that
only Apigee gateways could talk

00:35:11.760 --> 00:35:14.970
to your data centers itself.

00:35:14.970 --> 00:35:16.410
