00:35:27.600 --> 00:35:29.820
But we have actually
something called Extensions,

00:35:29.820 --> 00:35:33.750
which has now started
being leveraged to connect

00:35:33.750 --> 00:35:36.000
to GCP services.

00:35:36.000 --> 00:35:41.100
So things like
Pub/Sub, BigQuery, AIML

00:35:41.100 --> 00:35:43.560
