that are becoming available.

00:35:43.560 --> 00:35:47.460
And as we create more of these
extensions and connectors,

00:35:47.460 --> 00:35:49.260
our cloud customers
can then leverage

00:35:49.260 --> 00:35:53.460
to further integrate with
and extend their applications

00:35:53.460 --> 00:35:55.830
using GCP.

00:35:55.830 --> 00:35:57.880
OK, we do have another question.

