00:36:00.990 --> 00:36:02.370
Yes, we can.

00:36:02.370 --> 00:36:07.720
Monetization is a module that
sits as part of the platform.

00:36:07.720 --> 00:36:11.430
So we do have customers that are
leveraging monetization today

00:36:11.430 --> 00:36:15.690
